            "paragraph": "Furthermore, carbon storage via CCS is effectively permanent, offering a more resilient and durable option than relying solely on forest-stored carbon, which remains vulnerable to disturbances such as wildfire, windthrow, disease, and insect outbreaks 37,38. These risks are expected to increase in frequency and severity with rising global temperatures39, increasing the likelihood of abrupt carbon losses.",
